# --- Allowlist .gitignore ---
# Ignore everything at the project root by default, then re-include ONLY the
# code that should be backed up to GitHub. Any data/output/figures dropped in
# later stay LOCAL unless explicitly un-ignored here. Forgetting fails safe.

# 1. Ignore everything at the project root.
/*

# 2. Re-include only code + docs that go to GitHub.
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/*.py

# 3. Never track caches / checkpoints / OS cruft.
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.DS_Store
